				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6bf2ab2 animated-slow elementor-repeater-item-none elementor-repeater-item-none_hover elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-jet-headline" data-id="6bf2ab2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}" data-widget_type="jet-headline.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="jet-headline jet-headline--direction-vertical"><span class="jet-headline__part jet-headline__second"><span class="jet-headline__label">Built for Impact, <br class="desktop" />Powered by Transparency</span></span></h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f6d74d1 animated-slow elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-repeater-item-none elementor-repeater-item-none_hover elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="f6d74d1" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Our <strong>methods</strong> are <strong>transparent</strong>, verifiable, and rigorously validated. At its core, OpenET is about solutions—giving farmers, water managers, and communities the tools they need to make decisions.</p><p>Our <strong>data</strong> are <strong>openly</strong> available and made actionable through easy-to-use tools.</p><p>Our <strong>partnerships</strong> build <strong>trust</strong> and solutions that scale through genuine collaboration.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-cb2b0a8 animated-slow elementor-align-left elementor-mobile-align-justify elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-repeater-item-none elementor-repeater-item-none_hover elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="cb2b0a8" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}" data-widget_type="button.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-button-wrapper">
					<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-md" href="https://etdata.org/open-science-transparency/">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
									<span class="elementor-button-text">Open Science &amp; Transparency</span>
					</span>
					</a>
				</div>
								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1ea0ef0 e-con-full elementor-repeater-item-ang_container_no_padding elementor-repeater-item-none_hover e-flex elementor-repeater-item-none e-con e-child" data-id="1ea0ef0" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;ang_container_spacing_size&quot;:&quot;ang_container_no_padding&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}">
