						<div class="elementor-icon-box-content">

									<h3 class="elementor-icon-box-title">
						<span  >
							API						</span>
					</h3>
				
									<p class="elementor-icon-box-description">
						Provides automated access to ET data for large-scale or repeated use. Ideal for integrating ET into irrigation scheduling tools, hydrologic models, water accounting systems, or other applications.					</p>
				
